---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Manage a sandbox declared in an sbxenv.yaml file

Usage: sbt env [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  create  Create a sandbox environment from sbxenv.yaml
  run     Create (if needed) and attach to a sandbox environment
  exec    Execute a command inside a sandbox environment (not implemented yet)
  rm      Remove a sandbox environment and its scoped resources (not implemented yet)
  plan    Show what an environment would change outside the sandbox (not implemented yet)
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -h, --help
          Print help
